      "writtenOn": "2021-07-14T01:17:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point, thanks.\nIt\u0027s not very clear what a test should do if onLost gets called before the network can be read, a test that lets that happen is probably not setup correctly (it shouldn\u0027t expect the network to be available as it could also have gone away before the call to waitForAvailable) so I added a Log.w in case that happens.",
